<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
  <title>Email</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:400,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    table {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    span {
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
    }

    img {
      border: 0;
      display: block;
    }

    hr {
      border: none;
      color: #e1e1e1;
      background-color: #e1e1e1;
      height: 1px;
    }

    .padding-wrapper {
      padding: 0 30px;
    }

    .padding-wrapper--top {
      padding-top: 24px;
    }

    .padding-wrapper--bottom {
      padding-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .email-title {
      font-family: "Roboto", "Arial", sans-serif;
      color: #000000;
      margin: 0;
      text-align: left;
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 28px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .email-link {
      color: #58606b !important;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
    }

    .email-text {
      font-family: "Roboto", "Arial", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #000000 !important;
      font-style: normal;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 26px;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: none;
    }

    .im {
      color: #000000 !important;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;padding-bottom:40px;">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <div
            style="background-color: #212842;padding-top:61px;padding-bottom:0;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;">
            <table class="email" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center"
              style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#FFFFFF;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-position:top left;background-attachment:scroll;box-shadow:0 -12px 15px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.12);border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="padding-wrapper"
                    style="padding-top:36px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-right:30px;padding-left:30px;">
                    <h3 class="email-title"
                      style="font-family:'Roboto', 'Arial', sans-serif;color:#000000;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-align:left;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;font-size:24px;line-height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;">

                      Зміна пароля

                    </h3>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div
            style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:10px;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;background-color:#F7FAFC;height:100vh;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;">
            <table class="email" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center"
              style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#FFFFFF;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-position:top left;background-attachment:scroll;box-shadow:0 12px 15px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.12);border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="padding-wrapper"
                    style="padding-top:16px;padding-bottom:38px;padding-right:30px;padding-left:30px;">
                    <div class="email-text"
                      style="font-family:'Roboto', 'Arial', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#000000 !important;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;">
                      Дорогий {{name}}!
                      Була подана заявка на заміну пароля на сайті.
                      <br>
                      <br>
                      Перейдіть за <a href={{link}}>посиланням</a> щоб змінити пароль.

                    </div>




                    <br />
                    <div class="email-text"
                      style="font-family:'Roboto', 'Arial', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#000000 !important;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;">
                      Дякуємо, що Ви з нами!</div>

                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="padding-wrapper"
                    style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-right:30px;padding-left:30px;">
                    <div
                      style="height:4px;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;background-color:#F94F43;background: linear-gradient(90deg, #F94F43 0%, #EA9A2E 100%);">
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="padding-wrapper padding-wrapper--top"
                    style="padding-bottom:0;padding-right:30px;padding-left:30px;padding-top:24px;">
                    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;">
                      <tbody>

                        <tr>
                          <td style="padding-bottom:40px;">
                            <div>
                              <div class="email-text"
                                style="color:#58606B !important;font-family:'Roboto', 'Arial', sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;">
                                Чекаємо Вас </div><a href={{address}} target="_blank" class="email-text email-link"
                                style="font-family:'Roboto', 'Arial', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#58606b !important;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;">{{address}}</a>
                            </div>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</body>

</html>